-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619187_865025476306544_2921921643288615687_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=p7DvIiiBOMQQ7kNvwFU_YRy&_nc_oc=Adq7ukkWff888sDs411mvV1qK1yRPL-g0rYourSKu3Z0vfY3wRfU8OaM54DBJMry_EE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQK_oscDhif-Nsbujyb6Wn9LJeuU_ygSjEJ1_Ol6Z9cG4g&oe=6AA02294"}, "display_name": "StarDrone - Sling Star", "keywords": [], "long_description": "StarDrone: Sling Star is an award-winning, furiously energetic action-puzzle with a mix of arcade, pinball, breakout, and collect-the-objects. You pilot the always-in-motion space drone through diverse cosmic environments to beat each of all levels\u2019 goals. Goals can range from getting to the end of the level alive to destroying all enemies and collecting puzzle pieces. \nStarDrone: Sling Star is an IndieCade 2011 Finalist and IMGA 2017 award nominee.\n\nCause your attackers to crash rapidly while collecting starts, gems, and power-up enhancements. Overcome perilous hazards and elude zillions of enemies to complete each stage with a record score. With simple controls and unique, intuitive gameplay mechanics, StarDrone: Sling Star is friendly to beginners and, at the same time, challenging enough to bring you back for more and more.\n\n\u00a9 2025 Fortell Games, Inc.  \u00a9 2011-2025 Beatshapers Ltd. All rights reserved.", "short_description": "Furiously entertaining Hyper-Kinetic Race across the Galaxy with a mix of pinball, arcade action, and breakout hops on Meta Quest Family devices!\n"}, {"images": {"nodes": []}, "id": "1380168676853808", "locale": "de_DE", "screenshots": [], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "StarDrone -  Sling Star", "keywords": [], "long_description": "StarDrone Sling Star ist ein Hochgeschwindigkeitsthriller mit der Kombination der Arkade, Pinball, Durchbruchs, Physik und der Suche nach Gegenst\u00e4nde. Erforsche die Stufe, finde den Schl\u00fcssel der Speisung und verdiene mehr Punkte, was schlie\u00dflich dir mit der ganzen Welt auf dem Monitor StarDron zu k\u00e4mpfen erlaubt.\n\nStarDrone is an IndieCade 2011 Finalist and IMGA 2017 award nominee.\n\u00a9 2025 Fortell Games, Inc.  \u00a9 2011-2025 Beatshapers Ltd. All rights reserved.", "short_description": "StarDrone ist ein Hochgeschwindigkeitsthriller mit der Kombination der Arkade, Pinball, Durchbruchs, Physik und der Suche nach Gegenst\u00e4nde."}, {"images": {"nodes": []}, "id": "1179908393490654", "locale": "ko_KR", "screenshots": [], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "StarDrone - Sling Star", "keywords": [], "long_description": "\uc2a4\ud0c0 \ub4dc\ub860\uc740 \uc544\ucf00\uc774\ub4dc, \ud540\ubcfc, \ube0c\ub808\uc774\ud06c \uc544\uc6c3 \ubc0f \uc624\ube0c\uc81d\ud2b8 \uc218\uc9d1\uc774 \ud63c\ud569\ub41c \uc218\uc0c1 \uacbd\ub825\uc774 \uc788\ub294 \uaca9\ub82c\ud55c \uc5d0\ub108\uc9c0\ub97c \uac00\uc9c4 \uc561\uc158 \ud37c\uc990\uc785\ub2c8\ub2e4. \ub2e4\uc591\ud55c \uc6b0\uc8fc \ud658\uacbd\uc744 \ud1b5\ud574 \ud56d\uc0c1 \uc6c0\uc9c1\uc774\ub294 \uc6b0\uc8fc \ub4dc\ub860\uc744 \uc870\uc885\ud558\uc5ec \uac01 \ub808\ubca8\uc758 \ubaa9\ud45c\ub97c \ub2ec\uc131\ud558\uc138\uc694. \ubaa9\ud45c\ub294 \ub808\ubca8\uc758 \ub05d\uae4c\uc9c0 \uc0dd\uc874\ud558\ub294 \uac83\ubd80\ud130 \ubaa8\ub4e0 \uc801\uc744 \ud30c\uad34\ud558\uace0 \ud37c\uc990 \uc870\uac01\uc744 \uc218\uc9d1\ud558\ub294 \uac83\uae4c\uc9c0 \ub2e4\uc591\ud560 \uc218 \uc788\uc2b5\ub2c8\ub2e4. \uc2a4\ud0c0 \ub4dc\ub860\uc740 IndieCade\uc758 \uacb0\uc2b9 \uc9c4\ucd9c\uc791\uc774\uba70 IMGA \uc218\uc0c1 \ud6c4\ubcf4\uc791\uc785\ub2c8\ub2e4.\n", "short_description": "\uc6b0\uc8fc\ub97c \uac00\ub85c\uc9c0\ub974\ub294 \uaca9\ub82c\ud558\uac8c \uc990\uac70\uc6b4 \ucd08\uace0\uc18d \ub808\uc774\uc2a4\uac00 Meta Quest Family\uc5d0 \ucc38\uc5ec\ud588\uc2b5\ub2c8\ub2e4!"}, {"images": {"nodes": []}, "id": "737030175392775", "locale": "it_IT", "screenshots": [], "video_trailer": null, "vi